{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09689","headline":"喜韩樽相过 · 岑参","name":"喜韩樽相过","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三月灞陵春已老，故人相逢耐醉倒。\n瓮头春酒黄花脂，禄米只充沽酒资。\n长安城中足年少，独共韩侯开口笑。\n桃花点地红斑斑，有酒留君且莫还。\n与君兄弟日携手，世上虚名好是闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09689.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09689","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}